From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:32:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] C versions of the remaining assembly, and GCC fixes

OS (interrupt state, interrupt dispatch, lock IDs, thread helpers, context setup, halt, alarms, VRAM locks), coprocessor context save/restore, RTC and microphone busy-waits, 3D FIFO sends. Context switching and halting call into the port. Linker-script values (stack sizes, arena starts) are given directly. Declaration fixes GCC requires in pm.c and gxasm.h.
